---
import RootLayout from "~/layouts/RootLayout.astro";
---

<RootLayout
  metadata={{
    title: "FAQ — Soulful Bhakti",
    description:
      "Frequently asked questions about the Soulful Bhakti devotional music app: accounts, subscriptions, streaming, privacy and more.",
    keywords:
      "Soulful Bhakti, FAQ, frequently asked questions, devotional music app, subscription, premium",
    author: "Soulful Bhakti",
  }}
>
  <section class="p-4 md:p-16">
    <h2 class="h2">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <br />

    <div class="prose lg:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-4xl">
      <h3>About Soulful Bhakti</h3>

      <h4>What is Soulful Bhakti?</h4>
      <p>
        Soulful Bhakti is a devotional music app that blends the serenity of
        traditional ragas with modern instrumentation to create soulful
        devotional songs that bring peace, devotion and spiritual comfort. It is
        created for listeners of all ages and is ideal for morning prayers,
        meditation, quiet reflection or as a peaceful companion throughout the
        day.
      </p>

      <h4>Is Soulful Bhakti free to use?</h4>
      <p>
        Yes. The app is free to download and a large part of the catalog can be
        streamed without any account or payment. A premium subscription unlocks
        access to paid (premium) tracks.
      </p>

      <h4>Does the app show ads?</h4>
      <p>
        No. Soulful Bhakti does not display third-party advertising. The app is
        supported by optional premium subscriptions.
      </p>

      <h3>Accounts</h3>

      <h4>Do I need an account to use the app?</h4>
      <p>
        No. You can browse and listen to free tracks without signing in. Signing
        in with your Google account is optional and is needed to sync playlists,
        like songs, track your listening history, and access premium content.
      </p>

      <h4>How do I sign in?</h4>
      <p>
        Open the profile dialog in the app and choose &ldquo;Sign In&rdquo;. You
        will be prompted to sign in with your Google account. The app only
        requests the account information needed to provide the service.
      </p>

      <h3>Premium and Subscriptions</h3>

      <h4>What is Premium?</h4>
      <p>
        Premium is an optional subscription that unlocks paid tracks and other
        premium features in the app.
      </p>

      <h4>How do I subscribe or cancel?</h4>
      <p>
        Subscriptions are billed and managed through Google Play. You can
        subscribe inside the app and manage or cancel your subscription at any
        time in the Google Play Store app (Google Play &gt; Account &gt;
        Payments &amp; subscriptions).
      </p>

      <h4>I purchased a subscription but can&rsquo;t access premium content.</h4>
      <p>
        Make sure you are signed in with the same Google account used for the
        purchase and that your subscription is active in Google Play. If the
        issue persists, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:karthik@famerelay.com">karthik@famerelay.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h3>Streaming and Features</h3>

      <h4>What audio quality is available?</h4>
      <p>
        Music is streamed over an encrypted connection from our content delivery
        network. The available quality may vary by track.
      </p>

      <h4>Can I listen offline?</h4>
      <p>
        Offline/downloaded playback depends on the features available in the
        current version of the app. Please refer to the in-app feature
        documentation for the latest information.
      </p>

      <h3>Privacy and Support</h3>

      <h4>What data does the app collect?</h4>
      <p>
        We collect only what is needed to provide the service. Details, including
        the third-party services used, are described in our
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h4>How can I request deletion of my data?</h4>
      <p>
        Email us at
        <a href="mailto:karthik@famerelay.com">karthik@famerelay.com</a> and we
        will process your request.
      </p>

      <h4>How can I get support or report a problem?</h4>
      <p>
        Contact us through the <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page or email
        <a href="mailto:karthik@famerelay.com">karthik@famerelay.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</RootLayout>